----------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope of this distribution
----------------------------------------------------------------------

This open framework provides a generic MCP (Model Context Protocol)
interface for automating an EPLAN P8 instance and a minimal reference
add-in that demonstrates the host/add-in command channel.

This distribution contains only the open framework and its reference
add-in. Additional capabilities built on top of this framework may be
maintained separately and are not part of this open-source release.

